{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}2 & -3 \\\\ -4 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix  is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations: \n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}2 & -3 & 5 \\\\ -4 & 1 & -6\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-1052/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3f9ccaa5-d69c-584d-946e-0c57b3050160"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-1052"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-71722/selection/dd100eff8b7b98269d39f9b6334601c94fa9050446d54591c56bb367d3cbae63" :answer/id #uuid "a97786ff-7ca3-542d-9ad3-5612753e7c48" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 1 & -1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-71722/selection/fd447ccca3a7779e049373621a4c5973c4a09cfc4d2f620336db361513f1c6a7" :answer/id #uuid "a2e5a4cf-c626-571e-9739-342e8312b273" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & -3 \\\\ 2 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-71722/selection/5be7da2085086e6aaaa1ff8a7637432b78cd665ef7297495cf29672732f5747f" :answer/id #uuid "c5b80452-12b9-5ea6-89d8-e660225e9277" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}3 & 1 & -2 \\\\ -1 & 2 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-71722/selection/e8d0e8825d80e0776b1ca582d068605595ceca259af2940ffe6648468c6fad13" :answer/id #uuid "f3efe0ef-e145-5648-a1ca-631fbb55b726" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 2 & -3 \\\\ -2 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-71722/selection/af77a7a6deed2f98ff007a5e8b947640432c723cac1b9e49f931dc9a3cb104b7" :answer/id #uuid "e33c94ee-d059-5f9f-b841-d2d8cb9947c8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & -3 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 2\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-71722/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "c0aaedcf-8f9e-55a6-ad72-25a43e5ddd91" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-71722/selection/dd100eff8b7b98269d39f9b6334601c94fa9050446d54591c56bb367d3cbae63" :answer-field/choices ["q-71722/selection/dd100eff8b7b98269d39f9b6334601c94fa9050446d54591c56bb367d3cbae63" "q-71722/selection/fd447ccca3a7779e049373621a4c5973c4a09cfc4d2f620336db361513f1c6a7" "q-71722/selection/5be7da2085086e6aaaa1ff8a7637432b78cd665ef7297495cf29672732f5747f" "q-71722/selection/e8d0e8825d80e0776b1ca582d068605595ceca259af2940ffe6648468c6fad13" "q-71722/selection/af77a7a6deed2f98ff007a5e8b947640432c723cac1b9e49f931dc9a3cb104b7"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-71722" :question/id #uuid "671bb0ea-172d-5bcd-9af7-fde2cdb49f9b" :question/math-academy-id "q-71722" :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}x-3=2y \\\\ 1+y=-2x\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $x,y$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}x-2y=3 \\\\ 2x+y=-1\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 \\\\ 2 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix  is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations: \n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 2 & 1 & -1\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-71722/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3f9ccaa5-d69c-584d-946e-0c57b3050160"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-71722"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-1051"] :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}6x+y+z=4 \\\\ x+z=9\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $x,y,z$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}6x+y+z=4 \\\\ x+0y+z=9\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}6 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix  is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}6 & 1 & 1 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 1 & 9\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-1065/selection/27398e05d0e34a80d771a736f4c894775dab42fd7e0a3b96b4412a6a6f587c73" :answer/id #uuid "bee78068-611a-5f60-a037-79836f7e3281" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}9 & -3 & -1 & 16 \\\\ -8 & 4 & 0 & -15 \\\\ 20 & -1 & 3 & 0\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-1065/selection/129acd42c0ad7e04e0fecfbf40711d3b627b9a30ba6749e34c81bd306586fa70" :answer/id #uuid "f051bff9-5cd8-51f0-8aa4-fe8fba1d75e4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}9 & -3 & 1 & 16 \\\\ -8 & 4 & 0 & -15 \\\\ 20 & -1 & -3 & 0\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-1065/selection/55f0726924e32d693e963651e41be72145e61c8d95aa5aa36223a5f378032179" :answer/id #uuid "37e62520-92ae-5785-8379-ef9ef7047c95" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}9 & -3 & -1 & 16 \\\\ -8 & 4 & 15 & 0 \\\\ 20 & -1 & -3 & 0\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-1065/selection/2ab0255ef01aea33b608e8c479cc62a22138961ad8441970d9399131741633e5" :answer/id #uuid "522090dc-36f0-56fd-a06b-1105d0329721" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}9 & 3 & -1 & 16 \\\\ -8 & 4 & 0 & -15 \\\\ 20 & -1 & -3 & 0\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-1065/selection/59efd7c17f8d9033a0b493df09bb56d5edc7e569b557438595313c3adc512aae" :answer/id #uuid "f134631a-41c9-5ed3-bd2e-d55d607ed6d6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}9 & -3 & -1 & 16 \\\\ -8 & 4 & 0 & -15 \\\\ 20 & -1 & 0 & 3\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-1065/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "fd4bf66c-019d-5b56-8090-0535e183c9e0" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-1065/selection/2ab0255ef01aea33b608e8c479cc62a22138961ad8441970d9399131741633e5" :answer-field/choices ["q-1065/selection/27398e05d0e34a80d771a736f4c894775dab42fd7e0a3b96b4412a6a6f587c73" "q-1065/selection/129acd42c0ad7e04e0fecfbf40711d3b627b9a30ba6749e34c81bd306586fa70" "q-1065/selection/55f0726924e32d693e963651e41be72145e61c8d95aa5aa36223a5f378032179" "q-1065/selection/2ab0255ef01aea33b608e8c479cc62a22138961ad8441970d9399131741633e5" "q-1065/selection/59efd7c17f8d9033a0b493df09bb56d5edc7e569b557438595313c3adc512aae"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-1065" :question/id #uuid "48f98a93-db63-5763-8ec0-4ab60f16e55d" :question/math-academy-id "q-1065" :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}9x+3y-z=16 \\\\ 15-8x=-4y \\\\ -y+20x=3z\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $x,y,z$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}9x+3y-z=16 \\\\ -8x+4y+0z=-15 \\\\ 20x-y-3z=0\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}9 & 3 & -1 \\\\ -8 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 20 & -1 & -3\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix  is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}9 & 3 & -1 & 16 \\\\ -8 & 4 & 0 & -15 \\\\ 20 & -1 & -3 & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-1065/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "3f9ccaa5-d69c-584d-946e-0c57b3050160"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-1065"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-20361"] :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of  linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}-x+y=5 \\\\ x+y=6\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Notice that the system is already organized so that the variables are in the order $x,y$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient. \n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables: \n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\n \n\nThe augmented matrix  is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 & 5 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 6\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-129132/selection/3c73b0b2e1ed875484c67ea53019ad0cf63f576a38b2d98f8f5245796d86d87b" :answer/id #uuid "ee19f0f7-49fc-544b-b435-b111bf8cad46" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}7x-4y-9z=1 \\\\ 3x+y+5z=1 \\\\ 3x-4y+8z=3\\end{aligned}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129132/selection/fe6319f45312483bc4026878f42d9c0ac0b6968e1c21ab5120aadf48f93b2ea2" :answer/id #uuid "5ab98020-afde-5e1e-9d1e-37a213c7779c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}7x-4y=9 \\\\ -3x+y+5z=0 \\\\ 3x-4y+8z=3\\end{aligned}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129132/selection/55c0f1b15d66613bc83a1b50e7a36838c73cd96e6d832c91083f211947a2e310" :answer/id #uuid "8031a972-4167-5cef-94a8-7c1d0da6398b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}7x+4y=9 \\\\ 3x+y+5z=0 \\\\ 3x+4y+8z=3\\end{aligned}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129132/selection/ee7327178732c85f75f15e54d08d8b1e904abf463959e179e81182b9e241c7ca" :answer/id #uuid "8c4529d5-1d65-5ba4-94e3-fa0d58339aa5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}7x-4y+z=9 \\\\ -3x+y+5z=0 \\\\ 3x-4y+8z=3\\end{aligned}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129132/selection/2156856a1fde8dd453efdeaf313f8862907c44feacc19fcddce1ce28b1d0c4ac" :answer/id #uuid "092fa83e-e3f3-5058-a9d8-481437409870" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}7x-4y+9z=0 \\\\ -3x+y+5z=0 \\\\ 3x-4y+8z=3\\end{aligned}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129132/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "8bec9686-7dd8-5c83-baf8-f64e89f4afcb" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-129132/selection/fe6319f45312483bc4026878f42d9c0ac0b6968e1c21ab5120aadf48f93b2ea2" :answer-field/choices ["q-129132/selection/3c73b0b2e1ed875484c67ea53019ad0cf63f576a38b2d98f8f5245796d86d87b" "q-129132/selection/fe6319f45312483bc4026878f42d9c0ac0b6968e1c21ab5120aadf48f93b2ea2" "q-129132/selection/55c0f1b15d66613bc83a1b50e7a36838c73cd96e6d832c91083f211947a2e310" "q-129132/selection/ee7327178732c85f75f15e54d08d8b1e904abf463959e179e81182b9e241c7ca" "q-129132/selection/2156856a1fde8dd453efdeaf313f8862907c44feacc19fcddce1ce28b1d0c4ac"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-129132" :question/id #uuid "96962965-f338-5825-be42-329eb84d06e9" :question/math-academy-id "q-129132" :question/problem "What would be the system of equations for the following augmented matrix?\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}7 & -4 & 0 & 9 \\\\ -3 & 1 & 5 & 0 \\\\ 3 & -4 & 8 & 3\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix consists of two parts: the coefficient matrix and the column of constants.\n\nThe coefficient matrix represents the coefficients in the linear system, while the column of constants represents the constants on the right-hand sides of the equations.\n\nUsing the variables $x$, $y$, and $z,$ then, the corresponding system of equations is\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}7x-4y+0z=9 \\\\ -3x+y+5z=0 \\\\ 3x-4y+8z=3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nBy simplifying, we obtain\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}7x-4y=9 \\\\ -3x+y+5z=0 \\\\ 3x-4y+8z=3.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-129132/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d7c8f4da-c782-51e0-ac51-87a89f31860d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-129132"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-71724"] :question/problem "What would be the system of equations for the following augmented matrix?\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & -2 & 10 \\\\ -1 & 1 & -2\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix consists of two parts: the coefficient matrix and the column of constants.\n\nThe coefficient matrix represents the coefficients in the linear system, while the column of constants represents the constants on the right-hand sides of the equations.\n\nUsing the variables $x$ and  $y$,  the corresponding system of equations is\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x-2y=10 \\\\ -x+y=-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-20363/selection/6f4310bb84a380b70dec77e76d121c1c5c41cf6ce6f199f6b486d7aec9c190e0" :answer/id #uuid "319b04da-13f5-5b0a-9878-0f25442b35d4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\begin{aligned}2y+3z=0 \\\\ x+3z=2 \\\\ 2x+3y=3\\end{aligned}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {