e-554c-99aa-f0c3b91e55d7" :question/math-academy-id "q-129146" :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{3}m+5n=11 \\\\ 0=4n-8 \\\\ n=-6m+\\frac{2}{5}\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $m,n$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{3}m+5n=11 \\\\ 0m-4n=-8 \\\\ 6m+n=\\frac{2}{5}\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{3} & 5 \\\\ 0 & -4 \\\\ 6 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{3} & 5 & 11 \\\\ 0 & -4 & -8 \\\\ 6 & 1 & \\frac{2}{5}\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-129146/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "14d047c8-f032-5ff3-aced-65d40bfeeaad"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-129146"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-71733/selection/f3f9961bd8e8ac3f2c96b7606762e9bb449fe2db9e2be9852a83d80cbe5e0caa" :answer/id #uuid "0a3f3600-9316-5dc5-99a9-de44153fb00c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}5 & 3 & -5 \\\\ 3 & 5 & -3\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-71733/selection/0a43f7c0c5da23ba7a0c0c4c9852e91e25cf21bb7bcb8c1884cb4eeaa9e384ea" :answer/id #uuid "e35c8f0c-a7f5-5565-922b-fb17c30a5cd2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}3 & 5 & 5 \\\\ 5 & 3 & 3\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-71733/selection/fbf254d24d86613580d7f3f8f4151354b1d30c8cefa4b2c3927ca5e4fa29c867" :answer/id #uuid "697efabd-62d8-528d-8ac0-42