ry variable has a coefficient.   \n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables: \n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}3 & 5 \\\\ 5 & 3\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}3 & 5 & -5 \\\\ 5 & 3 & -3\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-71733/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "14d047c8-f032-5ff3-aced-65d40bfeeaad"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-71733"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-1073/selection/4954974ab9607fc2327b6493b988263f7db9581418b77c23e45e5b3494832212" :answer/id #uuid "9a03772b-fddf-5e64-a074-324986847827" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & -4 & -1 & 0 \\\\ -11 & 0 & 3 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-1073/selection/9b76fc68a1813a8f15936eafb97e47cb64e100adce1abc0d2d3fafd350246074" :answer/id #uuid "f059090e-21d6-5a5b-b273-e3166d57f754" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 & 4 \\\\ 3 & -11 & -1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-1073/selection/646970d7c32c9f903d4a2606524d131666058cf82bedb2c75cac0375bcc81e38" :answer/id #uuid "dce062a0-5de5-5867-95b1-9ce86bf2bdbc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 & 0 & 4 \\\\ -3 & -11 & 0 & -1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-1073/selection/f274caabaff7db434737cf20691f3c6dae7669938d4f7654ed5226068c8f4842" :answer/id #uuid "3976d8d5-0506-54c2-b6a1-38bf3153c2d3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & -1 & 4 \\\\ -11 & 0 & 3 & -1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-1073/selection/e0bf0d50fe7d0fa88c514c8a16e00d6b62d2ee937756d954bfbf76689591deac" :answer/id #uuid "1a99827c-2717-581d-8b5a-651c742d1883" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & -4 & -1 & 0 \\\\ -11 & 0 & 3 & -1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-1073/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "985d64bb-06ae-5391-a116-be05a339a83d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-1073/selection/e0bf0d50fe7d0fa88c514c8a16e00d6b62d2ee937756d954bfbf76689591deac" :answer-field/choices ["q-1073/selection/4954974ab9607fc2327b6493b988263f7db9581418b77c23e45e5b3494832212" "q-1073/selection/9b76fc68a1813a8f15936eafb97e47cb64e100adce1abc0d2d3fafd350246074" "q-1073/selection/646970d7c32c9f903d4a2606524d131666058cf82bedb2c75cac0375bcc81e38" "q-1073/selection/f274caabaff7db434737cf20691f3c6dae7669938d4f7654ed5226068c8f4842" "q-1073/selection/e0bf0d50fe7d0fa88c514c8a16e00d6b62d2ee937756d954bfbf76689591deac"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-1073" :question/id #uuid "f91a3a43-018b-5255-8209-a178e0a073de" :question/math-academy-id "q-1073" :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations? \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}a-c=4b \\\\ 3c-11a=-1\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $a,b,c$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}a-4b-c=0 \\\\ -11a+0b+3c=-1\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & -4 & -1 \\\\ -11 & 0 & 3\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & -4 & -1 & 0 \\\\ -11 & 0 & 3 & -1\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-1073/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "14d047