c350ef0218" :answer-field/choices ["q-129144/selection/fe2509385475a0ce6f6968585069cede75437dfc1a1afc786b04e8911a48d8aa" "q-129144/selection/fb27ce2f235f2b7aefc4a36656b7322e3684a94ee01d9faa419caec350ef0218" "q-129144/selection/154c50504f669bbeb05059460806703b3ae7f8e2788d661e452b2ce1ae45cb2e" "q-129144/selection/f9079f779045d74f5118f902a09f1b05357effe148cba7b55b84c283b2816d0c" "q-129144/selection/5769f024fa4075a800c7e8f253abd0ebb0d2a83dcf0820e58b240c77a1d74a13"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-129144" :question/id #uuid "c3026f39-025c-5a7c-a464-dd0bc4a5fcca" :question/math-academy-id "q-129144" :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}\\frac{7}{2}a=6b \\\\ 2a-7b=5 \\\\ 2a-4b+\\frac{3}{2}=0\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $a,b$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}\\frac{7}{2}a-6b=0 \\\\ 2a-7b=5 \\\\ 2a-4b=-\\frac{3}{2}\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{7}{2} & -6 \\\\ 2 & -7 \\\\ 2 & -4\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}\\frac{7}{2} & -6 & 0 \\\\ 2 & -7 & 5 \\\\ 2 & -4 & -\\frac{3}{2}\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-129144/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "14d047c8-f032-5ff3-aced-65d40bfeeaad"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-129144"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-1070/selection/443f1c63920952b4e5488373b1f15fb5819b9a9a812541af393b0afc918a3fd8" :answer/id #uuid "b48da1c6-744c-521d-bf38-f673a5855a2f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}4 & 2 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -11\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-1070/selection/02c4aea4837c79255c829e1d2b27a97a8305ddd407e0a4d02b513fc2b35803c2" :answer/id #uuid "cce466f8-0de5-56df-889f-435c29bf9ad7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}2 & 4 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -11 & 12\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-1070/selection/ca1b02b6ec8c205d51f361121af7e24536bc280bd16a16a999744c0f34a68dd9" :answer/id #uuid "aefcd95a-46ab-5f3b-a941-7a6e9ddcfe1e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}4 & 2 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -11\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-1070/selection/3db16deb25cb62100814b2ae47743a2e959aabcd3e3431a55596b5609efa14c5" :answer/id #uuid "6eea1eaa-159d-5255-ad76-00dc3dd5bd17" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}4 & 2 & -3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -11 & 12\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-1070/selection/22936d58b41d38027e4931d0922a0077c9526a2ef72b2485ace8a325dbca04e7" :answer/id #uuid "908d03b1-361e-52a1-8e95-f0166b76816e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}2 & 4 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -11\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-1070/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "542d69ba-6370-5a38-b227-d0546b5360e3" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-1070/selection/443f1c63920952b4e5488373b1f15fb5819b9a9a812541af393b0afc918a3fd8" :answer-field/choices ["q-1070/selection/443f1c63920952b4e5488373b1f15fb5819b9a9a812541af393b0afc918a3fd8" "q-1070/selection/02c4aea4837c79255c829e1d2b27a97a8305ddd407e0a4d02b513fc2b35803c2" "q-1070/selection/ca1b02b6ec8c205d51f361121af7e24536bc280bd16a16a999744c0f34a68dd9" "q-1070/selection/3db16deb25cb62100814b2ae47743a2e959aabcd3e3431a55596b5609efa14c5" "q-1070/selection/22936d58b41d38027e4931d0922a0077c9526a2ef72b2485ace8a325dbca04e7"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-1070" :question/id #uuid "231bb2d1-1f91-5097-b8e5-bbc8b36a788a" :question/math-academy-id "q-1070" :question/problem "What is the coefficient matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}2{x}_{2}+4{x}_{1}=3{x}_{3} \\\\ -11{x}_{3}=12\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered ${x}_{1},{x}_{2},{x}_{3}$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}4{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2}-3{x}_{3}=0 \\\\ 0{x}_{1}+0{x}_{2}-11{x}_{3}=12\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}4 & 2 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -11\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-1070/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "14d047c8-f032-5ff3-aced-65d40bfeeaad"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-1070"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "e-4683"] :question/problem "What is the coefficient matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}x-2y=1 \\\\ 2y=-1\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x-2y=1 \\\\ 0x+2y=-1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\left\\lbrack\n\t\\matrix {\n\t\t1 & -2 \\\n\t\t0 & 2 \n\t}\n\t\\right\\rbrack\n$$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "e-4684"] :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}y+x-5-3z=0 \\\\ z=y+7x \\\\ y+3-2z=1-2x\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $x,y,z$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x+y-3z=5 \\\\ -7x-y+z=0 \\\\ 2x+y-2z=-2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\left\\lbrack\n\t\\matrix {\n\t\t1 & 1 & -3 \\\n\t\t-7 & -1 & 1 \\\n                2 & 1 & -2 \n\t}\n\t\\right\\rbrack\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix  is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}1 & 1 & -3 & 5 \\\\ -7 & -1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 2 & 1 & -2 & -2\\end{aligned}\n$$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "e-4685"] :question/problem "What would be the system of equations for the following augmented matrix?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5 & -4 & -12 \\\\ 3 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix consists of two parts: the coefficient matrix and the column of constants.\n\nThe coefficient matrix represents the coefficients in the linear system, while the column of constants represents the constants on the right-hand sides of the equations.\n\nUsing the variables $x$ and $y,$ then, the corresponding system of equations is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5x-4y=-12 \\\\ 3x+y=1.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "e-4686"] :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}\\frac{c}{2}=a \\\\ 5+3b-a=4c \\\\ d=1\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $a,b,c,d$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-a+0b+\\frac{1}{2}c+0d=0 \\\\ -a+3b-4c+0d=-5 \\\\ 0a+0b+0c+d=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 & \\frac{1}{2} & 0 \\\\ -1 & 3 & -4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 & \\frac{1}{2} & 0 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 3 & -4 & 0 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}\n$$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]}]
